+### context supervise-task
+
+Run resumable CLI-owned post-processing for one CURATOR context result.
+
+Records the already-produced semantic SGR result, then applies, validates, indexes, evaluates, records ACR, and finalizes deterministic context work under one bounded supervisor episode.
+
+Usage:
+
+```text
+agentplane context supervise-task <task-id> --extraction <sgr-json> [options]
+```
+
+Options:
+
+- `--extraction <sgr-json>`: CURATOR-produced schema-valid context_extraction SGR file. (required)
+- `--smoke-query <query>`: Optional retrieval check; defaults to a semantic entity from the SGR.
+- `--evaluator <id>`: Read-only evaluator module id. (default=recovery-context)
+- `--json`: Emit machine-readable result. (default=false)
+
 ### context wiki explain
 
 Print a wiki page's Agentplane context frontmatter.
